{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261121/photo/bkn-20261121082406337-1121_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261121084143\"/><p>秘魯發生地震，星號為震央。</p><p>美國地質勘探局指，秘魯中部發生黎克特制6.7級地震，震源深度108公里，無觸發海嘯警報。震央位於秘魯首都利馬東北約270公里處，利馬震感強烈。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T01:03:52.277465+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T00:24:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T10:17:32.909530+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T00:57:23.225217+00:00","content_hash":"954bccd0d9e2b9a0e5d5b9373737bb107c43570eddf8213b04a1c75ffc6bee14","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}